cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the re-analysis, please cite it as below."
title: "Hypergraph-Nonlinear-Latency Voter Model"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation and reproducibility package for the Hybrid
  Hypergraph-Nonlinear-Latency voter model: group interactions on hypergraphs,
  a nonlinear adoption exponent, and heterogeneous reaction latencies.
  Version 2 fixes the prototype, adds tests, and re-examines the manuscript's
  claims with a paired, fully seeded design.
